      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "Madhu drew back."
    },
    {
      "box": {
        "height": 0.075,
        "width": 0.36,
        "x": 0.08,
        "y": 0.18
      },
      "channel": "DIALOGUE",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p17-dialogue-madhu",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p17-panel-01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "source_script_hash": "f2a8e24d70ae86ff40974278cc3d0f6673aebfad114327b5df3f39a9a00125c5",
      "speaker_id": "dm-madhu",
      "text": "Ask a boon of us."
    },
    {
      "badge_number": 2,
      "box": {
        "height": 0.06,
        "width": 0.23,
        "x": 0.69,
        "y": 0.115
      },
      "channel": "NARRATION",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p17-narration-b",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p17-panel-01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "source_script_hash": "70cfa622f26b39f9f8e24438d4122c2ef5e3a07fec1055e6e3ca8157f354e582",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "Kaitabha stood beside him."
    },
    {
      "box": {
        "height": 0.075,
        "width": 0.36,
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.18
      },
      "channel": "DIALOGUE",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p17-dialogue-kaitabha",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p17-panel-01",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "source_script_hash": "a4aaba4469b67ec55bc3e37f852e3ada21158c18489f30f6c7b1f4e63c61b0f0",
      "speaker_id": "dm-kaitabha",
      "text": "Yes. Choose what we shall give."
    },
    {
      "badge_number": 3,
      "box": {
        "height": 0.18,
        "width": 0.84,
        "x": 0.08,
        "y": 0.555
      },
      "channel": "NARRATION",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p17-narration-c",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p17-panel-02",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "source_script_hash": "77b38e52eec5b3503fb36f06105cab53381356b6cf7b7f6681d0865b22f4f702",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "After an age of combat, the strangest moment in the battle was not another blow. It was the offer made by the two who had come as enemies.\n\nThey had become the boon-givers.\n\nVishnu answered them."
    }
